{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日あつすぎーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もう盛大に蒸されて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小籠包になった気分でしたよ(-_-;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、先日乃木どこで標題曲のPVが公開されましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/17/3696827/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装はパジャマ、マッシュ、ギラギラの3パターンです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/17/3696827/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのマッシュルームカット"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人によって長さやスタイルが少しずつ違うんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のは一番短くてまん丸タイプ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は似合わないでしょぉーｑ(-ε-)ｐブゥー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/17/3696827/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなっちゃいましたが、慣れてくると新鮮で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんどん楽しくなりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/17/3696827/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/erika.ikuta/img/2012/07/18/%E3%81%84%E3%81%8F%E3%81%9F%EF%BC%93.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"似合ってますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は結構気に